cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the associated paper, Adaptive model completion for Gaussian
  approximation of elliptic PDEs, by Daniel Fernández and Enrique Zuazua,
  when using this code or its numerical records.
title: >-
  Code and data for Adaptive model completion for Gaussian approximation of elliptic PDEs
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fernández
    given-names: Daniel
    email: daniel.fernandez@fau.de
repository-code: https://github.com/danielfdzm/adaptive-desingularization
url: https://github.com/danielfdzm/adaptive-desingularization
abstract: >-
  Gaussian approximation solvers, recorded experiments, validation, figure and
  table generators, and supplementary materials for adaptive derivative
  completion of Gaussian models at fixed width.
keywords:
  - Gaussian approximation
  - divided differences
  - adaptive desingularization
  - neural PDE solvers
  - reproducible research
